    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Reflects the grant of 15,000 shares of common stock that members of the issuer's Board of Directors (the &quot;Board&quot;) receive quarterly as part of their annual compensation for Board service. The reporting person pays no consideration for these shares.</footnote>
